{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00848","headline":"郊庙歌辞 晋昭德成功舞歌 昭德舞歌二首 二 · 不详","name":"郊庙歌辞 晋昭德成功舞歌 昭德舞歌二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"淮海干戈戢，朝廷礼乐施。\n白驹皆就絷，丹凤复来仪。\n德备三苗格，风行万国随。\n小臣同百兽，率舞贺昌期。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00848.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00848","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}